  "body": "With LL, I got some weird behavior where I receive member event from state field while I already know this room member from my initial sync.  \r\n\r\nTo replicate this behavior, \r\n\r\nOn Client A - Create a room with 2 people (and make them join respectively)\r\nOn Client A - Send some messages\r\nOn Client A - Change member name\r\nOn Client A - Send a message again\r\nOn client B - Make an initial sync\r\nOn client A - Send again a message.\r\n\r\nOn client B we receive from the sync the last room member event already known from initial sync.\r\n\r\nIt does break some of our logic on client here to manage room state. \r\n",
